@host = http://localhost:5044
@token = pega-aqui-el-token

### Estado de la API
GET {{host}}/health

### Registro
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Pérez",
  "email": "ana@example.com",
  "password": "Clave1234"
}

### Inicio de sesión
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@example.com",
  "password": "Clave1234"
}

### Consultar perfil
GET {{host}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cambiar nombre
PUT {{host}}/api/profile/name
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana María Pérez"
}

### Cambiar contraseña
PUT {{host}}/api/profile/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Clave1234",
  "newPassword": "NuevaClave5678"
}

### Listar categorías activas
GET {{host}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear categoría
POST {{host}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alimentación",
  "color": "#F97316"
}

### Crear método de pago
POST {{host}}/api/payment-methods
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tarjeta",
  "icon": "credit-card"
}

### Listar métodos de pago incluyendo inactivos
GET {{host}}/api/payment-methods?includeInactive=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear gasto (reemplaza los identificadores)
POST {{host}}/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 850.50,
  "date": "2026-08-16",
  "categoryId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "paymentMethodId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "description": "Compra del supermercado"
}

### Listar gastos con filtros y paginación
GET {{host}}/api/expenses?fromDate=2026-08-01&toDate=2026-08-31&page=1&pageSize=20&search=supermercado
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
